          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Catra of Brightmoon, She-Ra of Brightmoon</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Catra ends up with the sword. Everything is different from that point on.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(Or: an abused child finds a sword and a new home, a new people, and a new family, and rises above all things to become a legend.)&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
